  blerg-runner checklist set "Reproduce the crash" "Write a failing test" "Fix it"
  blerg-runner checklist tick 2            (a number is the item's place, 1 is the first)
  blerg-runner checklist tick "Fix it"     (or its exact text; --text "2" when the text is a number)
